  "description": "Automatic HTTP traffic collection middleware for Azure App Services. Zero code changes required. Uses ASP.NET Core IHostingStartup to inject middleware for comprehensive API security monitoring. Supports .NET 6.0, 8.0, and 9.0. Captures complete request/response data including headers, bodies, and timing information. Dual modes: file logging and real-time Salt Security API integration.",
